<title>UK: Dresdner sets call warrants on the SMI index.</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets call warrants on the SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG has issued 250,000 European-style call warrants, on the SMI, lead manager Dresdner Bank (Schweiz) AG said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    4,500.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	5.87 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.48 CHF		  GEARING	10.4 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.MAR.97-31.MAR.98   PAYDATE	25.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  4,673.50 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  DRESDWARI</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
